OL,3,GNEWSAGold medal swimmer switches on
OL,4,AChristmas lights
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gold medallist swimmer has spoken of
OL,7,Fhis pride after switching on the
OL,8,FChristmas lights in his hometown.
OL,10,FJake Binns, 22, was voted by people in
OL,11,FShaftesbury, Dorset, to do the honours
OL,12,Ffollowing his success at the Special
OL,13,FOlympics GB in Birmingham this year.
OL,15,FHe won gold in the 25m butterfly and,
OL,16,Fas part of the South West team, in the
OL,17,F4x25m relay. He also won silver in the
OL,18,F25m freestyle.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
